The application range of these laws is broad, from biology and cell mechanics over the adhesion of wafers to crack propagation modeling.
%For future research, it would be beneficial to add a sliding potential and to improve integration rules.
Adding a tangential contact into the present formulation would be beneficial to model the behavior of sliding fibers. Furthermore, the efficiency of numerical integration can be improved by considering adaptive algorithms.

