\section{Experiments}
% 为了评估HNS在超图链路预测任务中的有效性和鲁棒性, 我们设计了一系列实验. 首先, 我们利用多种评价指标，比较了HNS与随机负采样和前沿的启发式负采样方法在相同数据集和相同模型下的预测精度. 其次, 我们进行了鲁棒性实验，先是分析了不同正负样本匹配策略对模型性能的影响，然后分析了注入强度$\alpha$对模型性能的影响。
To evaluate the effectiveness and robustness of HNS in hyperedge prediction tasks, we designed a series of experiments. Firstly, we compared the prediction accuracy of HNS with that of random negative sampling and state-of-the-art heuristic negative sampling methods using multiple evaluation metrics. Secondly, we conducted robustness experiments by analyzing the impact of different positive-negative sample matching strategies on model performance, and the effect of the injection strength $\alpha$ on model performance.


