    %   &= \varphi(q_{\vec{k}}) \sum_{\ell \in \N} \sum_{w \in \mathcal{W}_\ell}  \ip{\delta_{\vec{k}}, S^{(w_1)} \dots S^{(w_\ell)} \delta_{\vec{k}}} \, \mathring{e}_{a_1,b_1}^{(w_1)} \otimes \dots \otimes \mathring{e}_{a_\ell,b_\ell}^{(w_\ell)}.
