\subsection{Fano dual}

Consider the dual of the {\bf Fano plane}, denoted $M_{\text{Fano}}^{\ast}$. This is the paving matroid of rank four on $[7]$, with the following set of dependent hyperplanes:
\[\{4,5,6,7\},\{2,3,5,6\},\{2,3,4,7\},\{1,3,5,7\},\{1,3,4,6\},\{1,2,4,5\},\{1,2,6,7\}.\]
