\item[{\rm (ii)}] A matroid obtained by identifying 3 points outside a dependent hyperplane of $M_{\text{Fano}}^{\ast}$. 
\item[{\rm (iv)}] A matroid that is the direct sum of a quadrilateral set and the trivial rank-one matroid on a single element. %There are seven possibilities for this free point. 
