R> 15 gamma2[1,2,1,2]         0.446            0.442 
R> 16 gamma2[1,1,2,2]         0.0259           0.0410
R> 17 gamma2[1,2,2,2]         0.434            0.434
R> vprai_MCMC$naive_posterior_means_df
R> # A tibble: 9 x 3
R>   parameter_name      posterior_mean posterior_median
R>   <chr>                        <dbl>            <dbl>
R> 1 naive_beta[1,1]            -2.78            -2.78  
R> 2 naive_beta[1,2]             0.593            0.591 
R> 3 naive_beta[1,3]             0.265            0.268 
R> 4 naive_beta[1,4]             1.00             1.00  
R> 5 naive_beta[1,5]             0.157            0.157 
