				\hline
				\emph{Confusion Matrix \cite{fawcett2006introduction}} & Shows the percentage of the mean predictions by whether the prediction is a true negative, true positive, false negative or false positive, showing the specificity and sensitivity of the model. The mean of the samples of $p_i$ is used to assign labels. \\
