	\caption{Plot of the $L^2$-numerical errors of $\mathfrak{U}_0^J$ (left panel) and of $\mathfrak{U}_1^J$ and $\mathfrak{U}_2^J$ (right panel) as time step $\tau \rightarrow 0$, with fixed final time $T=1$.}
